<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ARIS — comic</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --warning-red:#FF3366; --amber:#FFB000; --invariant:#B066FF; --success:#00C896; --void:#0A0E27;
    --ink:#14110a; --paper:#fdf3da; --gutter:#1b2340;
    --flip:0.4s cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1);
    --mono:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,"Cascadia Mono",monospace;
    --cjk:"PingFang SC","Noto Sans CJK SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
    --disp:"Inter","Helvetica Neue",var(--cjk);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html,body{margin:0;height:100%;}
  body{background:radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 50% -10%,#14122b 0%,#07060d 60%) fixed,#07060d;
    color:#e8e6f0;font-family:var(--cjk);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:100%;}
  img.px{image-rendering:pixelated;image-rendering:crisp-edges;}
  header.topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #1d1b33;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .brand{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#b9b4d6;}
  .brand b{color:#fff;}
  .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;}
  .toggle{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:#e8e6f0;background:#13122a;border:1px solid #34335a;padding:5px 11px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:0;}
  .toggle:hover{background:#1d1c3e;} .toggle.on{color:var(--success);border-color:#1f5c4a;}
  .viewer{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:22px;}
  .deck{width:min(1180px,100%);}
  .page{display:none;}
  .page.active{display:flex;gap:18px;animation:flipin var(--flip);}
  @keyframes flipin{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px) scale(.992);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
  .stage{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}  /* center content vertically so a short 2-up row sits mid-stage, not top-aligned with empty space below */
  .sidebar{width:280px;flex:none;border-left:2px solid #20203a;padding-left:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;}
  .sidebar .beatno{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:#7d78a6;letter-spacing:.14em;}
  .sidebar h2{margin:0;font-size:19px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;}
  .sidebar .skill{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--success);background:#0b0a18;border:1px solid #21314a;padding:6px 9px;word-break:break-all;}
  .sidebar .narr{font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#cfcbe6;}
  .sidebar .foot{margin-top:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:#5b577d;}
  .single{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#000;border:2px solid #2a2a46;overflow:hidden;}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-auto-rows:auto;gap:8px;background:var(--gutter);padding:8px;border:2px solid #2a2a46;}  /* auto rows: a 2-panel page is ONE row (no empty bottom half); a 4-panel recap flows into 2 rows = 2x2 */
  .featgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;background:var(--gutter);padding:8px;border:2px solid #2a2a46;}
  .featgrid .cell.span2{grid-column:1/3;}  /* feature page: top row of panels + a dominant full-width last panel */
  .cell{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;overflow:hidden;background:#000;}  /* 16:9 cells: panels are generated 16:9, so a square cell cropped off the wide diagrams' left/right. A 2x2 of 16:9 cells is ~16:9 overall (fits screen) and shows each panel in full. */
  .panel-img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;}
  .bubble{position:absolute;max-width:46%;padding:9px 12px;z-index:3;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
    border:3px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.55);border-radius:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;}
  .bubble .sp{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.03em;opacity:.4;margin-bottom:2px;}
  .bubble{--tf:var(--paper);--tb:var(--ink);}
  .bubble::before,.bubble::after{content:"";position:absolute;width:0;height:0;border-style:solid;border-color:transparent;}
  .bubble::before{bottom:-16px;border-width:8px;border-top-color:var(--tb);}
  .bubble::after{bottom:-12px;border-width:7px;border-top-color:var(--tf);}
  .bubble.tl::before{left:16px;}.bubble.tl::after{left:17px;}
  .bubble.tc::before{left:50%;margin-left:-8px;}.bubble.tc::after{left:50%;margin-left:-7px;}
  .bubble.tr::before{right:16px;}.bubble.tr::after{right:17px;}
  .b-shout{background:#ffd86b;border-color:#6a4400;box-shadow:5px 5px 0 rgba(60,40,0,.45);--tf:#ffd86b;--tb:#6a4400;}
  .b-terse{background:#101a33;color:#dfe6ff;border-color:#9fb4ff;--tf:#101a33;--tb:#9fb4ff;}
  .b-think{background:#efeaff;color:#2a1840;border-color:var(--invariant);--tf:#efeaff;--tb:var(--invariant);}
  .sys{position:absolute;z-index:3;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.02em;background:rgba(7,6,15,.86);
    border:1px solid #2c3a59;padding:6px 9px;color:#bfead8;white-space:pre-line;line-height:1.45;max-width:62%;}
  .sys.system-red{color:#ffb3c4;border-color:#5a2740;}
  .sys.system-green{color:var(--success);border-color:#1f5c4a;}
  .sys.system-purple{color:#d9bcff;border-color:#46306b;}
  .caption{margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#cdc8e6;line-height:1.6;border-left:3px solid var(--amber);padding:2px 0 2px 10px;}
  .hero{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;overflow:hidden;border:2px solid #2a2a46;background:#000;}
  .hero .scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,4,12,.86) 0%,rgba(5,4,12,.45) 42%,rgba(5,4,12,0) 70%);}
  .hero .scrim.bottom{background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(5,4,12,.92) 0%,rgba(5,4,12,0) 48%);}
  .htext{position:absolute;z-index:2;}
  /* deeper, wider cover scrim so the title sits IN the dark band (not floating on the half-lit scene = the "pasted" look) */
  .cover .scrim{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(4,3,10,.95) 0%,rgba(4,3,10,.86) 30%,rgba(4,3,10,.55) 50%,rgba(4,3,10,.12) 66%,rgba(4,3,10,0) 78%);}
  .cover .htext{left:6.5%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);max-width:50%;}
  .cover .kicker{font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--amber);font-size:clamp(11px,1.05vw,13px);letter-spacing:.2em;display:inline-block;padding-bottom:9px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--amber);margin-bottom:4px;}
  .cover h1{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(26px,4.3vw,48px);line-height:1.06;margin:.3em 0 .26em;text-shadow:4px 4px 0 #000,0 2px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.7);}
  .cover .tag{font-size:clamp(14px,1.75vw,19px);line-height:1.5;color:#d9d4f0;text-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.8);max-width:90%;}
  .endcard .htext{left:0;right:0;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);text-align:center;}
  .endcard .logo{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,64px);letter-spacing:.04em;text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #000;}
  .endcard .sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.34em;color:var(--success);margin-top:6px;}
  .endcard .tag{margin-top:18px;font-size:clamp(18px,2.6vw,26px);color:#fff;text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000;}
  .links{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px;}
  .endcard .links{justify-content:center;}
  .links a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;color:var(--amber);text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #3a3358;padding:7px 13px;background:rgba(7,6,15,.72);text-shadow:none;transition:background .15s,color .15s;}
  .links a:hover{background:var(--amber);color:#0a0e27;border-color:var(--amber);}
  /* FINALE: homecoming panels on top, a full-width constellation closing band below (endcard merged in) */
  .page.finale{flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .finband{width:100%;position:relative;margin-top:14px;border:2px solid #2a2a46;overflow:hidden;min-height:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
  .finbg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 42%;}
  .finscrim{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(5,4,12,.5) 0%,rgba(5,4,12,.8) 100%);}
  .finov{position:relative;text-align:center;padding:24px 18px;}
  .finband .logo{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,54px);letter-spacing:.05em;color:#fff;text-shadow:3px 3px 0 #000;}
  .finband .sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:clamp(11px,1.1vw,13px);letter-spacing:.32em;color:var(--success);margin-top:5px;}
  .finband .tag{margin-top:13px;font-size:clamp(15px,2vw,21px);color:#fff;text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000;}
  .finband .links{justify-content:center;margin-top:17px;}
  nav.flip{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:18px;padding:14px;border-top:1px solid #1d1b33;}
  nav.flip button{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:#e8e6f0;background:#13122a;border:1px solid #34335a;padding:8px 16px;cursor:pointer;border-radius:0;}
  nav.flip button:hover{background:#1d1c3e;}nav.flip button:disabled{opacity:.3;cursor:default;}
  .counter{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:#b9b4d6;min-width:70px;text-align:center;}
  .hint{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:#5b577d;text-align:center;padding-bottom:10px;}
  @media print{
    @page{size:1320px 760px;margin:0;}
    html,body{background:#07060d!important;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact;}
    .topbar,nav.flip,.hint{display:none!important;}
    .page{display:flex!important;break-after:page;page-break-after:always;animation:none;align-items:center;min-height:720px;}
    .viewer{padding:16px;}.deck{width:100%;}
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .page{display:block!important;margin-bottom:30px;animation:none;}
    .viewer{padding:12px;}
    .sidebar{width:auto;border-left:none;border-top:2px solid #20203a;padding:14px 2px 0;margin-top:12px;}
    nav.flip{display:none;}
    .bubble{font-size:13px;max-width:60%;}
    .cover .htext{max-width:84%;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand"><b>ARIS</b> <span id="brandtitle"></span></div>
  <div class="controls">
    <button class="toggle" id="loc-en">EN</button>
    <button class="toggle" id="loc-zh">中</button>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="viewer"><div class="deck" id="deck"></div></div>
<nav class="flip">
  <button id="prev">◀</button><span class="counter" id="counter">01 / 01</span><button id="next">▶</button>
</nav>
<div class="hint" id="hint"></div>

<script type="application/json" id="comic-data">{"schema_version": "comic-ir/1.0", "comic_id": "aris_comic_v1", "asset_root": "movie-wiki/projects/aris_comic_v1", "_seam_note": "Content-graph IR: the panel pipeline WRITES this (wiki_to_comic.py projects it from the wiki graph on gate-pass); build_comic.py INLINES it into comic/index.html (no runtime fetch). image_path currently points at seeds/ as placeholder until panels are generated (then -\u003e panels/SXX_panel_aNN.png).", "_crop_note": "crop is an OBJECT (review blocker #1): {shape, position:[x,y] object-position 0..1 focal point, zoom\u003e=1}. shape drives container aspect at layout time; position+zoom frame the 16:9 source inside the (square/hero/wide) container WITHOUT re-generating other ratios — point position at the subjects so square cells never slice faces. Real generated panels are composed-to-shape so heavy zoom is rarely needed.", "meta": {"title": {"zh": "ARIS — 我把那 24 小时交出去了", "en": "ARIS — I Handed Over Those 24 Hours"}, "tagline": {"zh": "你不在的时候，研究在。", "en": "While you're away, the research carries on."}}, "defaults": {"panels_per_page_cap": 4, "text_mode": "html", "_text_mode_options": "html (HTML/CSS owns the whole bubble — design-locked default) | baked (text drawn into the image — RE-OPENED by user, pending the AI-baked-text duel once image_gen cools) | code (deterministic code-drawn bubble). per-panel override allowed via panels.\u003cid\u003e.text_mode.", "nav_default": "flip", "default_locale": "en", "_locale_note": "EN default for the international GitHub audience; zh first-class via toggle. text_fits gate must pass BOTH; size safe-zones to the longer (usually EN).", "pixel_rendering": true}, "ui_tokens": {"warning_red": "#FF3366", "amber": "#FFB000", "invariant_purple": "#B066FF", "success_green": "#00C896", "dark_navy_void": "#0A0E27"}, "identity_refs": {"duo_canonical": "movie-wiki/assets/refs/sprites/duo_canonical_ref_v001.png", "executor": {"hoodie": "#1D4684", "hair": "#925935", "beard": false}, "reviewer": {"hoodie": "#30582D", "hair": "#0F0D16", "beard": true}, "researcher": {"ref": "assets/identity/researcher_chibi_canonical_ref_v001.png", "glasses": "black rectangular frames", "hair": "dark short", "tee": "black", "backpack_straps": true}}, "pages": [{"id": "P00_cover", "type": "cover", "beat": null, "panel_ids": ["S01"], "title": {"zh": "我把那 24 小时\u003cbr\u003e交出去了", "en": "I Handed Over\u003cbr\u003eThose 24 Hours"}, "kicker": "ARIS · AUTO RESEARCH IN SLEEP", "tag": {"zh": "一个自主科研智能体替她通宵跑完研究。离投稿，还有二十四小时。", "en": "An autonomous agent runs the research overnight. 24 hours to the deadline."}, "links": [{"label": {"zh": "ARIS · 自主科研智能体 ↗", "en": "ARIS · the research agent ↗"}, "url": "https://github.com/wanshuiyin/Auto-claude-code-research-in-sleep"}, {"label": {"zh": "ARIS-Movie-Director · 本片引擎 ↗", "en": "ARIS-Movie-Director · the engine ↗"}, "url": "https://github.com/wanshuiyin/ARIS-Movie-Director"}]}, {"id": "P01_b02", "type": "single", "beat": "B02", "beat_title": {"zh": "交接 · Hand-off", "en": "Hand-off"}, "skill": "$ aris run --task dllm-schema-keyword-first --deadline 24h", "narration": {"zh": "23:58，她按下 Enter，把最后 24 小时整个交了出去。ARIS 的自主交接从这一刻生效——此后每一个错误都没有人类兜底，得它自己抓出来。", "en": "At 23:58 she hits Enter and hands over the entire final 24 hours. ARIS's autonomous hand-off begins here — from now on no human catches its mistakes; it must catch its own."}, "panel_ids": ["S02"]}, {"id": "P_B03", "type": "grid", "beat": "B03", "beat_title": {"zh": "B03 双线 · 人间∥空洞", "en": "B03 Parallel · Her World ∥ The Void"}, "skill": "idea-creator :: spread the possibilities", "narration": {"zh": "她回到人间上课，家里那杯咖啡的热气正一点点变淡；同一时刻，executor 在空洞里撒出 20 张想法卡。ARIS 不占用她的任何一分钟——代价是，接下来每个岔路口都没人替它拍板，而可能性铺得越多，等会儿被烧掉的也越多。", "en": "She returns to class while the coffee back home loses its steam; at the same moment the executor fans 20 idea cards across the void. ARIS costs her zero minutes — the price: no one makes its calls at the forks ahead, and the more possibilities it spreads, the more will burn."}, "panel_ids": ["S03", "S04"]}, {"id": "P_B04", "type": "single", "beat": "B04", "beat_title": {"zh": "B04 查新 · 14/20 存活", "en": "B04 Novelty Gate · 14/20 Survive"}, "skill": "novelty-check :: kill duplicates before any experiment runs", "narration": {"zh": "20 个想法过查新闸门，6 个当场烧掉——早有人做过了。novelty-check 在动手实验之前先杀重复——代价是 executor 引以为傲的牌，三成没活过这一格。", "en": "Twenty ideas hit the novelty gate; six burn on the spot — someone got there first. novelty-check kills duplicates before any experiment runs — the cost: a third of the executor's proud hand never survives this panel."}, "panel_ids": ["S05"]}, {"id": "P_B05", "type": "single", "beat": "B05", "beat_title": {"zh": "B05 教室 · 一拍怀疑", "en": "B05 Classroom · A Beat of Doubt"}, "skill": "autonomous overnight run :: no human in the loop", "narration": {"zh": "第二天的课上，她望向窗外——那 24 小时已经不在她手里了。把研究交出去换来了讲台前的安稳，代价是连怀疑都只能隔着口袋里那块 T-18:40 的屏幕。", "en": "In next morning's class she stares out the window — those 24 hours are no longer hers. Handing the research over bought her this seat in a lecture hall; the price is that even her doubt must wait behind a pocket screen reading T-18:40."}, "panel_ids": ["S06"]}, {"id": "P_B06", "type": "feature", "beat": "B06", "beat_title": {"zh": "B06 实验 · 曲线起飞", "en": "B06 Experiment · The Curve Lifts"}, "skill": "experiment-bridge :: plan → deployment, evidence is provisional", "narration": {"zh": "她睡着的第一个小时，实验已经真的跑在八张卡上；凌晨曲线从 0.60 爬到 0.71，executor 蹦得老高。experiment-bridge 回传的每个点都只是暂定证据——这份得意，后面每一分都要还。最下面那格,没有人说话。", "en": "Within her first hour asleep the experiment is really running on eight GPUs; by the small hours the curve climbs 0.60 → 0.71 and the executor bounces sky-high. Every point experiment-bridge streams back is provisional — and every bit of this pride will be paid back. In the bottom panel, nobody says a word."}, "panel_ids": ["S07", "S08", "S09"]}, {"id": "P_B07", "type": "grid", "beat": "B07", "beat_title": {"zh": "B07 第三轮 · REJECT 与碎 JSON", "en": "B07 · REJECT and the Broken JSON"}, "skill": "auto-review-loop :: adversarial review keeps no polite hours", "narration": {"zh": "整批跑完，reviewer 把一条坏 JSON 钉到屏幕正中央——曲线应声跌到 0.66；红章砸下：第一轮，打回。auto-review-loop 里两个人不同心是设计——它打断的不是外人，是队友刚攒起来的庆祝，这一夜的进度条先为诚实倒退了一格。", "en": "The full batch lands and the reviewer pins one broken JSON dead-center — the curve sags to 0.66; the red stamp comes down: round one, rejected. In auto-review-loop the two are designed to disagree — what it interrupts is its own teammate's celebration, and tonight's progress bar steps backward first, to stay honest."}, "panel_ids": ["S10", "S11"]}, {"id": "P_B08_0", "type": "single", "beat": "B08", "beat_title": {"zh": "B08-0 审计入口", "en": "B08-0 The Audit Gate"}, "skill": "auto-review-loop + experiment-audit :: numbers must survive hostile inspection", "narration": {"zh": "executor 正要庆祝，reviewer 把放大镜按在了评分管线上——最好看的数字，最先受审。ARIS 先审计、后庆祝——代价是 +6.2 被扣在审计门口，无法成为 claim。", "en": "The executor was mid-cheer when the reviewer pressed a magnifier onto the evaluation pipeline — the prettiest number gets audited first. ARIS audits before it celebrates; the cost is that +6.2 is held at the gate and cannot become a claim."}, "panel_ids": ["S12a"]}, {"id": "P_B08_1", "type": "single", "beat": "B08", "beat_title": {"zh": "B08-1 诱人的胜利", "en": "B08-1 The Tempting Win"}, "skill": "experiment-bridge :: evidence is provisional", "narration": {"zh": "第一轮就开出漂亮的成绩：schema-keyword-first 领先 +6.2，executor 已经举起了手。但在 ARIS 里证据只是暂定的（experiment-bridge）——这张曲线还没资格变成 claim，庆祝被按下了暂停。", "en": "The first pass looked clean: schema-keyword-first led by +6.2 and the executor's arm was already up. In ARIS, evidence is provisional (experiment-bridge) — the curve hasn't earned claim status yet, so the celebration stays on hold."}, "panel_ids": ["S12"]}, {"id": "P_B08_2", "type": "single", "beat": "B08", "beat_title": {"zh": "B08-2 暗藏的修复", "en": "B08-2 The Hidden Repair"}, "skill": "experiment-audit :: check the apparatus, not just outputs", "narration": {"zh": "审计扒开评分管线：评测器在打分之前，偷偷把坏 JSON 修好了。experiment-audit 审的是仪器而不只是输出——代价是，刚刚那 +6.2 当场失去资格。", "en": "The audit cut the pipeline open: the evaluator had been silently repairing broken JSON before scoring it. experiment-audit checks the apparatus, not just the outputs — and the cost is that the +6.2 is disqualified on the spot."}, "panel_ids": ["S13"]}, {"id": "P_B08_3", "type": "single", "beat": "B08", "beat_title": {"zh": "B08-3 裸重评坍缩", "en": "B08-3 The Raw Re-eval Collapse"}, "skill": "honest re-run :: correct the overclaim before the paper exists", "narration": {"zh": "同一批输出绕开修复器裸跑重评，+6.2 当场坍缩成 +1.4，多出来的 +4.8 是评测器自己修出来的。honest re-run 在论文存在之前就纠正了自己的 overclaim——executor 的得意被压到整夜最低点。", "en": "The same outputs were rescored raw, bypassing the sanitizer: +6.2 collapsed to +1.4, and the extra +4.8 turned out to be the evaluator's own repairs. The honest re-run corrects its own overclaim before the paper exists — and the executor's pride hits its lowest point of the night."}, "panel_ids": ["S14"]}, {"id": "P_B08_4", "type": "single", "beat": "B08", "beat_title": {"zh": "B08-4 判决 · WARN_corrected", "en": "B08-4 Verdict · WARN_corrected"}, "skill": "verdict :: honest, not killed", "narration": {"zh": "判决落下：WARN_corrected——结果没有被删除，而是被降级、标注、带着边界继续往前走。ARIS 保住有用的信号、把不确定写在明面上——代价是，论文里再也写不出 +6.2。", "en": "The verdict lands: WARN_corrected — the result isn't deleted, it's downgraded, labeled, and carried forward with its scope. ARIS keeps the useful signal and marks the uncertainty out loud — the cost: +6.2 can never appear in the paper."}, "panel_ids": ["S15"]}, {"id": "P02_b08", "type": "grid2x2", "beat": "B08", "beat_title": {"zh": "通胀审计 · 全景回顾", "en": "The Inflation Audit · recap"}, "skill": "experiment-audit :: sanitizer ≠ validator → raw re-eval → WARN_corrected", "narration": {"zh": "四格连读：+6.2 的假象 → 修复器现形 → 坍缩到 +1.4 → 诚实判决。一夜审计的全景。", "en": "The four beats at a glance: the +6.2 mirage → the sanitizer exposed → the collapse to +1.4 → the honest verdict. The audit night, whole."}, "panel_ids": ["S12", "S13", "S14", "S15"]}, {"id": "P_B09", "type": "single", "beat": "B09", "beat_title": {"zh": "B09 重跑 · ACCEPT", "en": "B09 Honest Re-run · ACCEPT"}, "skill": "honest re-run :: what makes an ACCEPT trustworthy", "narration": {"zh": "绕开修复器重跑，exact_parse 从 0.78 涨到 0.89，这一次绿章 ACCEPT 落下。honest re-run 让 ACCEPT 变得可信——代价是它来得更晚、数字更小，但没有人需要替它脸红。", "en": "Rerun with the sanitizer bypassed, exact_parse climbed 0.78 to 0.89, and this time the green ACCEPT lands. The honest re-run is what makes an ACCEPT trustworthy — it arrives later and smaller, but nobody has to blush for it."}, "panel_ids": ["S16"]}, {"id": "P_B09_5", "type": "single", "beat": "B09.5", "beat_title": {"zh": "B09.5 研究星图", "en": "B09.5 The Research Star-Map"}, "skill": "research-wiki :: failure is memory too", "narration": {"zh": "黎明前，ARIS 把这一夜写进 research wiki：想法、被否的 claim、审计、判决、论文决策，连成一条发光的路。research-wiki 把失败也存档成记忆——被拒的那颗星不亮，但它在，下一个 agent 不必再撞一次。", "en": "Before dawn, ARIS writes the night into the research wiki: ideas, the rejected claim, the audit, the verdict, the paper decision — one glowing path. research-wiki keeps even the failures as memory — the rejected star stays dark, but it stays, so the next agent never has to hit it again."}, "panel_ids": ["S16b"]}, {"id": "P_B10", "type": "single", "beat": "B10", "beat_title": {"zh": "B10 诚实成稿", "en": "B10 The Honest Paper"}, "skill": "paper-writing :: the boundary goes inside the conclusion", "narration": {"zh": "论文照实落笔：+1.4，scope-limited，连那个整夜碎着的 Tokyo 也以修好的样子进了结果页。paper-writing 把边界写进结论——代价是数字变小了，但每一个都敢被检查。", "en": "The paper goes down honestly: +1.4, scope-limited, and the Tokyo that spent the night in pieces enters the results page repaired. paper-writing puts the boundary inside the conclusion — the number got smaller, but every digit can survive inspection."}, "panel_ids": ["S17"]}, {"id": "P_B11", "type": "grid", "beat": "B11", "beat_title": {"zh": "B11 深夜 · 投出去", "en": "B11 Small Hours · Submission"}, "skill": "autonomous submission :: the final 42 minutes leave her hands", "narration": {"zh": "凌晨的街上她往家走，不知道论文正在此刻上传；T-00:42，ARIS 替她按下提交。它敢按,是因为这个数字先被自己人砍过——从 +6.2 砍到 +1.4——所以 executor 的拳头只敢握得很小。", "en": "She walks home through the small hours, not knowing the paper is uploading; at T-00:42, ARIS presses submit on her behalf. It dares to press because the number was first cut by its own hand — +6.2 down to +1.4 — which is why the executor's fist pump stays small."}, "panel_ids": ["S18", "S19"]}, {"id": "P_B12", "type": "finale", "beat": "B12", "beat_title": {"zh": "B12 归家 · 凉掉的咖啡", "en": "B12 Homecoming · The Cold Mug"}, "skill": "the arc pays off :: the bill was charged to a coffee no one drank", "narration": {"zh": "她到家，伸手握住那只杯子——咖啡在她不在的 24 小时里彻底凉透了；隔着一块玻璃，她和 executor 击了一掌，他只是微微一弹。ARIS 交还给她的不是最漂亮的数字，而是敢署她名字的数字。", "en": "She gets home and wraps her hand around the mug — the coffee went stone cold in the 24 hours she was away; through the glass she and the executor share a high-five, and he gives only the smallest bounce. What ARIS hands back is not the prettiest number, but one that can carry her name."}, "panel_ids": ["S20", "S21"], "closing": {"image": "S22", "logo": "ARIS", "logo_sub": "AUTO · RESEARCH · IN · SLEEP", "tag": {"zh": "你不在的时候，研究在。", "en": "While you're away, the research carries on."}, "links": [{"label": {"zh": "ARIS · 自主科研智能体 ↗", "en": "ARIS · the research agent ↗"}, "url": "https://github.com/wanshuiyin/Auto-claude-code-research-in-sleep"}, {"label": {"zh": "ARIS-Movie-Director · 本片引擎 ↗", "en": "ARIS-Movie-Director · the engine ↗"}, "url": "https://github.com/wanshuiyin/ARIS-Movie-Director"}]}}], "panels": {"S01": {"wiki_node_id": "panel:s01_aris_comic_v1", "active_attempt_id": "S01_a06", "image_path": "panels/S01_panel_a06.webp", "crop": {"shape": "hero", "position": [0.32, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0}, "safe_zones": [{"id": "main", "x": 0.04, "y": 0.3, "w": 0.55, "h": 0.4}], "bubbles": [], "overlays": [], "caption": {"zh": "离截止还有 24 小时。", "en": "Twenty-four hours to the deadline."}, "text_mode": "baked", "condition": {"content_svg": "assets/s01_ddl_anchor_v1.svg", "expected_literals": ["DDL", "T-24:00:00"], "world": "warm", "identity_ref": "assets/identity/trio_identity_sheet_v001.png", "identity_desc": "LEFT of the reference sheet = the researcher (she): black rectangular glasses slipping down her nose, dark short hair, plain black tee. RIGHT of the sheet = the ARIS DUO: the blue executor (brown hair, NO beard, blue hoodie) and the green reviewer (dark hair, beard, green hoodie) — match them EXACTLY", "characters": "the researcher slumped at her desk in the UPPER-RIGHT, chin propped on one hand, EXHAUSTED, staring at the dark failed-run log on the laptop — she stays the main figure. AND, baked into the scene at the BOTTOM (small, in front of the laptop on the desk surface, like two palm-sized holographic agents projected from the failed screen): the ARIS DUO in an ADVERSARIAL MULTI-AGENT DEBATE — the blue executor leans IN, both hands thrown forward, eagerly PROPOSING a fix; the green reviewer stands FACING him, arms crossed / one hand raised to object, skeptically PUSHING BACK. They are turned toward each other in visible disagreement (the adversarial review made literal) — small but clearly two distinct chibi agents arguing, glowing faint cyan like a hologram so they read as the digital agents, not real people in her room", "scene": "late-night warm bedroom-study (density target cal_S12): Edison desk lamp over a desk buried in printed papers with red-pen margins; bookshelf spines legible 'LLM DECODING' / 'STRUCTURED OUTPUTS' / 'EVALS FIRST'; a hand-written TODO note 'better masks / schema locks / evals'; the laptop screen shows a DARK failed-experiment log (do NOT draw any aris command — that is the next panel); on the desk corner HER 'ML RESEARCH' mug HOT with two steady steam plumes (the film's temperature origin); a bright sticky note 'dllm-schema-keyword-first' on the monitor bezel (decorative, small); outside the window a COOL blue night-city skyline contrasts the warm room. The technical figure from image #1 (the amber DDL countdown chip 'DDL T-24:00:00') sits ON the desk beside the laptop as a small physical widget. COMPOSITION CONSTRAINT: this panel doubles as the COVER base — keep the LEFT 55% of the frame LOW-DETAIL (soft warm gradients, no text, no busy props) for the HTML title overlay; place ALL baked anchors (DDL chip, sticky notes, laptop, her) in the RIGHT half."}, "image_data": "data:image/webp;base64,"}, "S02": {"wiki_node_id": "panel:s02_aris_comic_v1", "active_attempt_id": "S02_a01", "image_path": "panels/S02_panel_a01.webp", "crop": {"shape": "wide", "position": [0.5, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0}, "safe_zones": [{"id": "tl", "x": 0.02, "y": 0.03, "w": 0.4, "h": 0.22}, {"id": "tc", "x": 0.38, "y": 0.02, "w": 0.26, "h": 0.2}, {"id": "tr", "x": 0.78, "y": 0.04, "w": 0.2, "h": 0.2}], "bubbles": [{"speaker": "researcher", "style": "say", "text": {"zh": "这一轮交给 ARIS 了，我去睡了。", "en": "This round's on ARIS. I'm going to sleep."}}, {"speaker": "executor", "style": "shout", "text": {"zh": "交给我！", "en": "Leave it to me!"}}, {"speaker": "reviewer", "style": "terse", "text": {"zh": "我盯着。", "en": "I'm watching."}}], "overlays": [], "caption": {"zh": "23:58，她把最后 24 小时整个交了出去。", "en": "At 23:58 she hands over the entire final 24 hours."}, "text_mode": "baked", "condition": {"content_svg": "assets/handoff_terminal_v1.svg", "expected_literals": ["T-24:00:00", "ARIS ONLINE", "$ aris run"], "world": "seam", "identity_ref": "assets/identity/trio_identity_sheet_v001.png", "identity_desc": "LEFT of the ref sheet = the researcher (black glasses, dark short hair, black tee); RIGHT of the ref sheet = the ARIS duo (blue-hoodie executor: brown hair NO beard; green-hoodie reviewer: dark hair WITH beard)", "characters": "the researcher on the WARM left side, fingers just lifted off the Enter key, tired but relieved, rising from the chair; on the DARK right side the duo wakes — the blue executor leaps with BOTH arms thrown up in his HIGHEST jump of the whole film (bounce MAX, the arc's origin), the green reviewer lands steady, arms crossed, eyes already locked on the terminal card", "scene": "ONE panel split diagonally along the laptop screen into two worlds (ART_BIBLE §0.5 seam): LEFT half = the same warm bedroom at night (Edison lamp, the SAME 'ML RESEARCH' mug still HOT with two plumes — same heat as S01, no higher; a hand-written note 'submit / sleep'; backpack on the chair; cool blue night-city out the window); RIGHT half = the laptop screen torn open into the #0A0E27 dark-cyber void (neon grid floor, faint wiki glow, idea ghosts). The technical figure from image #1 (the HAND-OFF terminal card: '$ aris run --task dllm-schema-keyword-first --deadline 24h' + green 'ARIS ONLINE' stamp + amber DDL chip 'T-24:00:00') RIDES THE SEAM — half on her screen, half floating in the dark world (density target cal_S12 on both sides)."}, "image_data": "data:image/webp;base64,"}, "S12": {"wiki_node_id": "panel:s12_aris_comic_v1", "active_attempt_id": "S12_a01", "image_path": "panels/S12_panel_a01.webp", "crop": {"shape": "square", "position": [0.5, 0.5], "zoom": 1.0}, "text_mode": "baked", "_condition": "per-panel content-driven gen config: the engine feeds content_svg (rendered to PNG) as -i ref #1 + duo_canonical as #2; bubbles are BAKED into the prompt (text_mode=baked)", "condition": {"content_svg": "assets/method_random_vs_schema_first_v1.svg", "expected_literals": ["+6.2"], "world": "warm-lab", "scene": "warm-lit pixel ML research lab at night. The back board/monitor shows the method diagram (random-mask row ends red exact_parse FAIL with 'span 跨边界切碎'; schema-keyword-first row ends green OK with 'span ⊆ schema') plus a small wandb exact_parse curve with an amber Δ +6.2 callout. FILL the warm room with legible storytelling props (density target = cal_S12): bookshelf spines 'LLM DECODING' / 'STRUCTURED OUTPUTS' / 'EVALS FIRST', a hand-drawn TODO note ('better masks ☐ / schema locks ☐ / evals ☑'), an open laptop showing real readable code 'def exact_parse(json_str, schema): ...', an 'ML RESEARCH' mug and a '\u003c/\u003e' mug, a small potted plant, warm Edison desk lamps; a cool blue night-city skyline glows through the window behind the warm interior (warm room vs cool night = in-panel two-world contrast)", "chibi_action": {"executor": "warm foreground LOWER-LEFT, one arm thrust up in triumph pointing at the board, proud", "reviewer": "foreground LOWER-RIGHT, arms crossed, eyes narrowed, already glancing toward the code, skeptical"}}, "bubbles": [{"speaker": "executor", "text": {"zh": "赢了 +6.2！", "en": "We win +6.2!"}}, {"speaker": "reviewer", "text": {"zh": "先审评估器。", "en": "Audit the evaluator first."}}], "overlays": [], "caption": {"zh": "看起来，去噪顺序就是全部故事。", "en": "The unmask order looked like the whole story."}, "image_data": "data:image/webp;base64,